       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MARK-CALC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TOTAL-MARK PIC 9(3) VALUE 450.
       01 MAX-MARK PIC 9(3) VALUE 500.
       01 PERCENTAGE PIC 99V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE PERCENTAGE =
               TOTAL-MARK * 100 / MAX-MARK

           DISPLAY "TOTAL MARK: " TOTAL-MARK
           DISPLAY "MAXIMUM MARK: " MAX-MARK
           DISPLAY "PERCENTAGE: " PERCENTAGE

           STOP RUN.